  "notes": [
    "Building blocks for every module — test, reconfigure, setting help, validation; module guidelines",
    "Manage AidenHQ from your own Claude; retire channel-operator",
    "The AidenHQ MCP for the owner's own Claude",
    "An OAuth sign-in and card decisions for the owner's MCP clients",
    "Verify-security.sh covers the GitHub connection's new surface; /grades refuses before it validates; setup no longer runs it",
    "Fleet Steward checks and outside-repo triage wait for the owner on a new install",
    "The MCP's validators ignore inherited keys and match the real id formats",
    "The MCP fences a value unless its key's own check proves the board made it",
    "The AidenHQ MCP's results stay small and valid in live use",
    "Flow records every merge, the owner's CI and owner authorship",
    "Grant task_file_upload so a file deliverable can be attached",
    "Paperclip setup writes only the agents and routines that differ"
  ],
